# Team Meeting & Remote Support Scaffold

This repository is intended to be a simple, working starter for a LAN-based meeting + support app.

It includes:
- ASP.NET Core 8 Web API
- SignalR hub for signaling and chat
- WebRTC client page with mic/camera and screen sharing
- SQL Server setup ready for Docker Compose
- Room max-size enforcement (10 users)
- Remote control request/grant exchange

Note: actual OS-level remote mouse/keyboard input requires a native Windows helper; browser-side WebRTC alone cannot drive the host OS.
